# L1 (latency), member a (k10), the host: first into stag0101 (NEW); b joins about 15 s later by a JOIN with catch-up
# (the field report of 31.10); both wander for 100 s of sealed play. Run with --net UP[/DOWN] (each client behind its own
# proxy) or a scenario "impair".
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@90
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
wander 460 170 15 until present=2,sealed>=6000
log enough
idle until frames>=60
